><span>Valeur métal au moment de l’achat</span><strong><?=$metalAtBuy!==null?money($metalAtBuy,$hi['gold_price_currency']):'—'?></strong></div><div class="settings-info"><span>Valeur métal à la fin de période</span><strong><?=$metalNow!==null?money($metalNow,$hi['gold_price_currency']):'—'?></strong></div><?php if($hi['status']==='sold'):?><div class="settings-info"><span>Prix de vente</span><strong><?=money($hi['sale_price'],$hi['currency'])?></strong></div><div class="settings-info"><span>Notes de vente</span><strong><?=h($hi['sale_notes']?:'—')?></strong></div><?php endif;?><div class="notice"><span>ⓘ</span><p>Le prix du métal n’est pas la valeur marchande totale d’une montre ou d’un bijou. Les montants de devises différentes ne doivent pas être comparés sans conversion.</p></div></article></div>
<?php $phq=$db->prepare('SELECT * FROM item_photos WHERE item_id=? ORDER BY (path=?) DESC,id ASC');$phq->execute([$hi['id'],(string)$hi['photo']]);$gallery=$phq->fetchAll();?><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Photos (<?=count($gallery)?>/<?=MAX_PHOTOS_PER_ITEM?>)</h3><p class="muted">La photo principale sert de vignette dans l’inventaire.</p></div></div><div class="photo-gallery"><?php foreach($gallery as $gph):$isCover=($gph['path']===$hi['photo']);$exists=is_file($root.'/'.$gph['path']);?><figure class="photo-tile"><?php if($exists):?><a href="<?=h($gph['path'])?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="<?=h($gph['path'])?>" alt="<?=h($hi['name'])?>" loading="lazy"></a><?php else:?><span class="photo-missing">Fichier manquant</span><?php endif;?><figcaption><?php if($isCover):?><span class="flag-pill cover">★ Principale</span><?php else:?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="set_cover_photo"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$hi['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="photo_id" value="<?=$gph['id']?>"><button class="btn subtle" type="submit">★ Principale</button></form><?php endif;?><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Supprimer cette photo ?')"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete_item_photo"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$hi['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="photo_id" value="<?=$gph['id']?>"><button class="btn subtle" type="submit">Supprimer</button></form></figcaption></figure><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$gallery):?><p class="empty">Aucune photo pour cet article.</p><?php endif;?></div><?php if(count($gallery)<MAX_PHOTOS_PER_ITEM):?><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="add_item_photos"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$hi['id']?>"><label>Ajouter des photos (JPG, PNG ou WebP, 5 Mo max. chacune)<input type="file" name="photos[]" multiple required accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><small>Limite totale d’envoi du serveur : <?=h((string)ini_get('post_max_size'))?>.</small></label><button class="btn primary">Téléverser</button></form><?php endif;?></article>
<article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Frais et rentabilité réelle</h3><p class="muted">Ajoutez réparations, nettoyage, commissions ou autres coûts. Les devises restent séparées.</p></div></div><form method="post" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="add_item_cost"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$hi['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="return_page" value="history"><label>Date du frais<input type="date" name="cost_date" value="<?=$today?>" required></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Type<select name="cost_type"><?php foreach(['Réparation','Nettoyage','Commission','Transport','Évaluation','Autre'] as $ct):?><option><?=h($ct)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Devise<select name="currency"><?php foreach(['CAD','USD','EUR'] as $cc):?><option <?=$cc===$hi['currency']?'selected':''?>><?=$cc?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Description<input name="description" required maxlength="180" placeholder="Ex. remplacement du bracelet"></label><label>Montant<input type="number" name="amount" min="0" step="0.01" required></label></div><button class="btn primary">Ajouter le frais</button></form><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Type / description</th><th>Montant</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($itemCosts as $ic):?><tr><td><?=date('d/m/Y',strtotime($ic['cost_date']))?></td><td><?=h($ic['cost_type'])?> · <?=h($ic['description'])?></td><td><?=money($ic['amount'],$ic['currency'])?></td><td><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Supprimer ce frais ?')"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete_item_cost"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$hi['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="cost_id" value="<?=$ic['id']?>"><button class="btn subtle">Supprimer</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$itemCosts):?><tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">Aucun frais supplémentaire enregistré.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div><div class="settings-info"><span>Total des frais dans la devise de l’article (<?=h($hi['currency'])?>)</span><strong><?=money($sameCurrencyCosts,$hi['currency'])?></strong></div><?php if($hi['status']==='sold'):?><div class="settings-info"><span>Marge après frais saisis (même devise uniquement)</span><strong class="<?=$netMargin>=0?'text-green':'text-red'?>"><?=money($netMargin,$hi['currency'])?></strong></div><?php endif;?><?php if(count($costTotals)>1 || (count($costTotals)===1&&!isset($costTotals[$hi['currency']]))):?><div class="notice"><span>ⓘ</span><p>Certains frais sont dans une autre devise et ne sont pas soustraits de la marge. Aucun taux de conversion n’est supposé.</p></div><?php endif;?></article>
<?php $prq=$db->prepare('SELECT * FROM price_history WHERE item_id=? ORDER BY changed_at DESC,id DESC');$prq->execute([$hi['id']]);$priceRows=$prq->fetchAll();$lastDropRow=null;foreach(array_reverse($priceRows) as $pr){if($pr['old_price']!==null&&(float)$pr['new_price']<(float)$pr['old_price']&&($hi['status']!=='sold'||!$hi['sale_date']||$pr['changed_at']<=$hi['sale_date']))$lastDropRow=$pr;}?><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Historique des prix de détail</h3><p class="muted">Chaque modification du prix affiché est datée pour mesurer l’effet des baisses.</p></div></div><?php if($hi['status']==='sold'&&$hi['sale_date']):?><div class="notice"><span>ⓘ</span><p><?php if($lastDropRow):$dd=max(0,(int)((strtotime($hi['sale_date'])-strtotime($lastDropRow['changed_at']))/86400));$dp=((float)$lastDropRow['old_price']-(float)$lastDropRow['new_price'])/(float)$lastDropRow['old_price']*100;?>Vendu le <?=h(date('d/m/Y',strtotime($hi['sale_date'])))?>, <strong><?=$dd?> jour(s)</strong> après la dernière baisse (<?=h(date('d/m/Y',strtotime($lastDropRow['changed_at'])))?>, −<?=h(pctFmt($dp))?>). Cela n’établit pas que la baisse est la cause de la vente.<?php else:?>Aucune baisse de prix enregistrée avant la vente.<?php endif;?></p></div><?php endif;?><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Ancien prix</th><th>Nouveau prix</th><th>Variation</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($priceRows as $pr):$hasOld=$pr['old_price']!==null;$vp=$hasOld?(((float)$pr['new_price']-(float)$pr['old_price'])/(float)$pr['old_price']*100):null;?><tr><td><?=h(date('d/m/Y',strtotime($pr['changed_at'])))?></td><td><?=$hasOld?h(money($pr['old_price'],$pr['currency'])):'—'?></td><td><strong><?=(float)$pr['new_price']>0?h(money($pr['new_price'],$pr['currency'])):'Prix retiré'?></strong></td><td><?php if($vp===null):?><span class="muted"><?=(float)$pr['new_price']>0?'Prix défini':'—'?></span><?php else:?><strong class="<?=$vp<0?'text-gold':'text-green'?>"><?=h(pctFmt($vp,true))?></strong><?php endif;?></td><td><?=h($pr['note']??'')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$priceRows):?><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Aucun prix de détail enregistré. Renseignez le prix dans la fiche de l’article.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article>
<article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Événements de l’article</h3><p class="muted">Entrée en stock et vente enregistrée.</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Événement</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $ev=$db->prepare('SELECT event_type,event_date,note FROM item_events WHERE item_id=? ORDER BY event_date ASC,id ASC');$ev->execute([$hi['id']]);$events=$ev->fetchAll();foreach($events as $event):?><tr><td><?=date('d/m/Y',strtotime($event['event_date']))?></td><td><?=h($event['event_type']==='purchase'?'Achat / entrée en stock':($event['event_type']==='sale'?'Vente':($event['event_type']==='reopen'?'Remise en stock':'Mise à jour')))?></td><td><?=h($event['note'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$events):?><tr><td><?=date('d/m/Y',strtotime($hi['purchase_date']))?></td><td>Achat</td><td>Historique initial reconstitué depuis la fiche</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article><p><a class="text-link" href="index.php?page=inventory">← Retour à l’inventaire</a></p>
