s, pas les fichiers.</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Archive</th><th>Photos incluses</th><th>Compte</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $backs=$db->query('SELECT b.*,u.email FROM backup_history b LEFT JOIN users u ON u.id=b.created_by ORDER BY b.id DESC LIMIT 30')->fetchAll();foreach($backs as $b):?><tr><td><?=h($b['created_at'])?></td><td><?=h($b['filename'])?></td><td><?=$b['includes_photos']?'Oui':'Non'?></td><td><?=h($b['email']??'—')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$backs):?><tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">Aucune sauvegarde complète enregistrée.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>Journal d’audit récent</h3><p class="muted">Connexions et principales opérations de gestion.</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Utilisateur</th><th>Action</th><th>Objet</th><th>Détails</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $logs=$db->query('SELECT a.*,u.email FROM audit_log a LEFT JOIN users u ON u.id=a.user_id ORDER BY a.id DESC LIMIT 100')->fetchAll();foreach($logs as $log):?><tr><td><?=h($log['created_at'])?></td><td><?=h($log['email']??'Compte supprimé/inconnu')?></td><td><?=h($log['action'])?></td><td><?=h(($log['entity_type']??'').(isset($log['entity_id'])&&$log['entity_id']?' #'.$log['entity_id']:''))?></td><td><?=h($log['details'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$logs):?><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Aucun événement journalisé.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article>
